3bd6d1da","start":593,"end":685},{"id":"zhuge-e-o087b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-d41a085ff97a0e287185","layer":"original","quote":"次子京及攀子显等，咸熙元年内移河东。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":410,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":17,"end":35},{"id":"zhuge-e-p052a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-303a491be10b09862ae5","layer":"pei","quote":"诸葛亮在蜀，尽其心力；其子瞻，临难而死义。天下之善一也，其孙京，随才署吏。”后为郿令。","attribution":"《晋泰始起居注》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2b19446d410da5a67516","start":32,"end":75},{"id":"zhuge-e-p052b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-303a491be10b09862ae5","layer":"pei","quote":"尚书仆射山涛《启事》曰：“郿令诸葛京：祖父亮，遇汉乱分隔，父子在蜀；虽不达天命，要为尽心所事。京治郿，自复有称；臣以为宜以补东宫舍人，以明事人之理，副梁、益之论。”京位至江州刺史。","attribution":"山涛《启事》及裴注","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2b19446d410da5a67516","start":75,"end":165},{"id":"zhuge-f0012-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-303a491be10b09862ae5","layer":"pei","quote":"京字行宗","attribution":"《诸葛氏谱》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2b19446d410da5a67516","start":13,"end":17},{"id":"zhuge-q-o087","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-d41a085ff97a0e287185","layer":"original","quote":"瞻长子尚，与瞻俱没〖21〗。﹝二﹞次子京及攀子显等，咸熙元年内移河东。﹝三﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":410,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38},{"id":"zhuge-q-p052","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-303a491be10b09862ae5","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞按《诸葛氏谱》云：“京字行宗。”《晋泰始起居注》载诏曰：“诸葛亮在蜀，尽其心力；其子瞻，临难而死义。天下之善一也，其孙京，随才署吏。”后为郿令。尚书仆射山涛《启事》曰：“郿令诸葛京：祖父亮，遇汉乱分隔，父子在蜀；虽不达天命，要为尽心所事。京治郿，自复有称；臣以为宜以补东宫舍人，以明事人之理，副梁、益之论。”京位至江州刺史。","attribution":"《晋泰始起居注》及山涛《启事》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2b19446d410da5a67516","start":0,"end":165}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
